--- a variable declared a tensor (whole numbers written down) and given a
--- list in a loop stays the tensor its declaration made, the list
--- converted where it is assigned: the loop's shape pass had joined it to
--- the list's form, and `last = level` was lowered unconverted — an
--- internal error
fn f[n]
    level = [n]
    last = [0]
    rounds = 0
    while rounds lt 2
        last = level
        level = push[[], 5]
        rounds = rounds + 1
    return last[0]

log[f[3]]
